Rule 2 (x and y tensors should have at least one dimension)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) > 0 ∧ ndim(y) > 0
>>
Rule 6 (x and y tensors should not be empty)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) > 0 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : shape(y, i) > 0
>>
Rule 18 (ndim(x) equals ndim(y))
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ndim(x) = ndim(y)
>>
Rule 26 (shape of x and y are compatible for broadcasting along each dimension)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1
>>
Rule 34 (Number of dimensions must be greater than zero.)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) > 0) ∧ (ndim(y) > 0)
>>
Rule 35 (Shape compatibility for broadcasting. At least one dimension must be 1 or equal.)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : (shape(x, i) = shape(y, i) ∨ shape(x, i) = 1 ∨ shape(y, i) = 1)
>>
Rule 36 (If x is a scalar, y must also be a scalar)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= (ndim(x) = 0) ∧ (ndim(y) = 0) ∨ (ndim(x) > 0 ∧ ndim(y) > 0)
>>
Rule 45 (Shape compatibility for broadcasting)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : ((shape(x, i) = shape(y, i)) ∨ (shape(x, i) = 1) ∨ (shape(y, i) = 1))
>>
Rule 46 (Ensure all shape dimensions are positive)
{x : tensor, y : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(x) - 1] : (shape(x, i) > 0) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(y) - 1] : (shape(y, i) > 0)
>>
